    Brazilian Portuguese. English in res/values is the fallback for anything
    missing here.

    The qualifier is values-pt-rBR, which is what matches a pt-BR device while
    leaving values-pt free for European Portuguese later. Only pt-BR is
    translated today; a pt-PT player falls back to English rather than reading
    Brazilian wording, which is the honest outcome until someone writes that
    file.
-->
